Attribution
================================================================================

This project is a community integration. It is derived from the OpenViking
project (https://github.com/volcengine/OpenViking), and in particular from that
repository's `examples/` directory, which is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (that repository's root — the main project — is AGPL-3.0, but
`examples/` carries its own Apache-2.0 LICENSE and its README says so
explicitly).

Files derived from OpenViking's examples/, and what was changed
----------------------------------------------------------------

  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/shared/*.mjs
      Unmodified copies, generated by that project's
      `examples/memory-plugin-shared/sync.mjs` from
      `examples/memory-plugin-shared/lib/`. Each file carries its own
      "GENERATED FROM ... DO NOT EDIT" header. To update them, change the
      shared library upstream and re-run that generator.

  codebuddy-memory-plugin/skills/*/SKILL.md
      Copies of `examples/skills/*`.

  codebuddy-memory-plugin/hooks/hooks.json
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/.mcp.json
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/servers/mcp-proxy.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/config.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/debug-log.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/session-start.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/auto-recall.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/auto-capture.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/pre-compact.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/session-end.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/subagent-start.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/subagent-stop.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/ov-memory-doctor.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/lib/ov-session.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/lib/host-compressor.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/lib/state.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/lib/workspace-peer.mjs
      Ported from that project's `examples/claude-code-memory-plugin/` and
      adapted for the CodeBuddy host (different hook envelope, different event
      set, different state directory, different compressor flags, and so on).
      The porting decisions and every measured host fact behind them are
      recorded in `codebuddy-memory-plugin/docs/HOST-CONTRACT.md`.

  memory-plugin-shared/testing/support.mjs
      Vendored copy of `examples/memory-plugin-shared/testing/support.mjs`,
      kept at the same relative path the plugin's tests import from, with a
      single import redirected — see the file header. It exists so this
      repository's `npm test` runs without an OpenViking checkout.

Files written for this project
------------------------------

  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/cb-transcript.mjs
      New: the CodeBuddy transcript decoder. It shares the semantics of that
      project's server-side `workbuddy` ingest adapter but is not a copy of it.
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/uri-guard.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/scripts/*.test.mjs
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/docs/HOST-CONTRACT.md
  codebuddy-memory-plugin/README.md, README_CN.md
  README.md, NOTICE, .codebuddy-plugin/marketplace.json

